#: includes/network.php:197
msgid "Short domains"
msgstr "Kurzdomains"

#: includes/network.php:198
msgid "Sites of the network with their own short domain (e.g. a short .de domain as an empty site). Their links can be offered from every site, the home page of a short domain leads to the main site."
